name = "Nilou – Skill"
element = "Water"
description = "While either Nilou''s skill or burst is active all enemies within 5 tiles of Nilou will have water passively reapplied to them constantly.

Grants the entire party the Dance of Haftkarsvar for 2 turns. While active, the effects from the water + nature combination are enhanced:
Nature + Water - Heals all allies within 3 tiles for 1D8 Health
Water + Nature - Vines reach out and damage everyone in the party for D20 of Nature Damage."
